  DialougeLines:
  - ...
  - 'Dr. Watson: Linda, prepare the girl''s medicine.'
  - 'Dr. Watson: Today is the 12th of April, 1992.'
  - 'Nurse Linda: Alright Lily, it''s time to take your medicine today.'
  - ...
  - 'Dr. Watson: No noticeable change in symptoms.'
  - 'Dr. Watson: I will be increasing the dosage next week. Hopefully it''ll be enough.'
  - 'Dr. Watson: I have some business to take care of, keep her busy Linda.'
  - 'Nurse Linda: Yes, sir.'
  - ...
  - 'Nurse Linda: Sorry Lily, something just came up. Be good and stay here, okay?'
  - 'Lily: Linda..?'
  - ...
  - 'Lily: I am bored. I''ll look for something to do.'
